{"uid":"modules/unified_bridge.py","name":"unified_bridge.py","qualname":"modules/unified_bridge.py","kind":"module","file":"modules/unified_bridge.py","line":1,"end_line":490,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"UnifiedBridge — single API over all LazyOwn bridges and routing engines.","description":"Merges three previously isolated bridges into one cohesive interface:\n- lazyown_bridge  : command catalog + phase/service-aware selection\n- toposwarm_bridge: neural/keyword routing from natural language\n- mcp_agent_bridge: AI agent delegation (Groq/Ollama)\n\nPlus integration with EventBus (all routing decisions published) and\nStateManager (context from current campaign state).\n\nDesign (SOLID)\n--------------\n- Single Responsibility : route prompts to tools; delegate to agents.\n- Open/Closed           : add backends via register_route_backend().\n- Liskov                : all backends return RouteResult with same shape.\n- Interface Segregation : route() and delegate() are the only two operations.\n- Dependency Inversion  : depends on RouteBackend abstraction, not concrete bridges.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["modules/unified_bridge.py::RouteResult","modules/unified_bridge.py::DelegateResult","modules/unified_bridge.py::RouteBackend","modules/unified_bridge.py::KeywordBackend","modules/unified_bridge.py::LazyownBridgeBackend","modules/unified_bridge.py::TopoSwarmBackend","modules/unified_bridge.py::UnifiedBridge","modules/unified_bridge.py::route_prompt","modules/unified_bridge.py::delegate_task"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
